AccountingDefaultNotNotifiedExportDateDesc=If enabled, each exported line will be stamped with the export date. To modify a line marked as exported, you will need to delete the entire accounting entry and re-transfer it to accounting.
AccountingDefaultNotifiedValidationDate=By default, validate and lock exported accounting entries
AccountingDefaultNotifiedValidationDateDesc=If enabled, exported accounting entries will be automatically validated and locked (same effect as the "Close" feature). Editing and deletion of these lines will be PERMANENTLY impossible.
AccountingDefaultNotifiedExportFull=By default, export source documents (Available only on some export models Quadra | FEC | FEC2)
AccountingDefaultNotifiedExportFullDesc=If enabled, source documents associated with accounting entries (invoices, credit notes, etc.) will be included or attached when generating the export file.
